{"speciesId":741,"names":{"fr":"Plumeline","es":"Oricorio","en":"Oricorio","ja":"オドリドリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il réunit ses ailes pour générer du feu. Sa chorégraphie envoûtante noie l’ennemi sous un torrent de flammes."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Junta las alas y lanza voraces llamas al rival. Su ataque se asemeja a una elaborada coreografía de fuego."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It beats its wings together to create fire. As it moves in the steps of its beautiful dance, it bathes opponents in intense flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"羽を 打ち合わせて 発火。 華麗な ステップを 踏みながら 激しい 炎を 浴びせかけるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Après avoir bu du Nectar Rouge, Plumeline se lance dans une ardente danse qui consume le cœur de ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Forma que toma Oricorio al libar Néctar Rojo. Hace arder el corazón de sus adversarios con su cálida danza."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Oricorio has sipped red nectar. Its passionate dance moves cause its enemies to combust in both body and mind."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"くれないのミツを 吸った オドリドリ。 情熱的な ステップで 敵の 身も 心も 焼き尽くす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il envoûte ses ennemis avec une danse fougueuse, et profite de leur inattention pour les noyer sous un torrent de flammes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Con su danza apasionada cautiva al enemigo. En cuanto este baja la guardia, lo calcina con sus enormes llamaradas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It wins the hearts of its enemies with its passionate dancing and then uses the opening it creates to burn them up with blazing flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"情熱的な ダンスで 敵の 心を つかみ 油断した 隙に 燃えさかる 炎で 焼き尽くす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Plumeline ayant bu du Nectar Rouge. D’un naturel passionné, il brûle de rage quand son Dresseur se trompe 